From: MichaIng <micha@dietpi.com>
Subject: [PATCH] s7d: pwm_plat.h: include stdint.h

The header uses uint32_t. It was provided implicitly via stdio.h by newlib 3, but not anymore by recent newlib versions.
---
diff --git a/s7d/pwm_plat.h b/s7d/pwm_plat.h
index 46224a4..1be3c55 100644
--- a/s7d/pwm_plat.h
+++ b/s7d/pwm_plat.h
@@ -14,6 +14,7 @@
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
 #endif
+#include <stdint.h>
 #include <register.h>
 
 enum meson_pwm_id {
